WEBVTT

00:06.000 --> 00:13.000
LLM Studio: a multi-model chat workspace
with accounts and per-user history.

00:13.000 --> 00:22.000
Ask a question; the reply streams
token by token.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000
Saved conversations are scoped
to the authenticated account.

00:27.000 --> 00:33.000
Choose a model through one interface
for cloud providers and local Ollama.

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
Follow-ups use chat context.
Daily quotas limit shared-key usage.

00:38.000 --> 00:42.720
Argon2id auth, 31 tests in the case study,
and free-tier hosting.
